(6803074, 1022622, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like what you have done here. The exposure is bang on and that is awesome with the differing brightness in the lights. The scene is wonderfully composed. I feel it is a touch out of balance and I think adding a person on the stairs may have provided that needed balance. Possibly someone at the top silhouetted in that open space. Why don''t you, on your own expertly edit a brightly lit moon in the sky. Perhaps the brightness of the moon would also help balance the shot!</td>', 'I like what you have done here. The exposure is bang on and that is awesome with the differing brightness in the lights. The scene is wonderfully composed. I feel it is a touch out of balance and I think adding a person on the stairs may have provided that needed balance. Possibly someone at the top silhouetted in that open space. Why don''t you, on your own expertly edit a brightly lit moon in the sky. Perhaps the brightness of the moon would also help balance the shot!', '2012-06-27 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
