(6803536, 1022936, 137320, '<td valign="top">Tones are fantastic. The contrast of the sharp building with the smooth sky really makes it pop. My highest rated, and a ribbon winner IMO.</td>', 'Tones are fantastic. The contrast of the sharp building with the smooth sky really makes it pop. My highest rated, and a ribbon winner IMO.', '2012-06-28 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803540, 1022347, 137320, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out why I like this so much. I think it''s the green and yellow tones on the great texture of the bottom side of this building. The second bridge coming out in the background is a really a nice touch. My highest rated of the bunch ribbon or tt for sure.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out why I like this so much. I think it''s the green and yellow tones on the great texture of the bottom side of this building. The second bridge coming out in the background is a really a nice touch. My highest rated of the bunch ribbon or tt for sure.', '2012-06-28 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803543, 1022994, 137320, '<td valign="top">The highlights seem a little hot on this, but absolutely love the tones. The colors/warmth reminds me a lot of some that I have shot. High marks from me, keep it up!</td>', 'The highlights seem a little hot on this, but absolutely love the tones. The colors/warmth reminds me a lot of some that I have shot. High marks from me, keep it up!', '2012-06-28 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803544, 1023035, 137320, '<td valign="top">Love this structure, and masterfully shot!</td>', 'Love this structure, and masterfully shot!', '2012-06-28 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803547, 1022398, 137320, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the color of the sky here. I think a less saturated sky would have brought out more of the water/rainbow. Perfectly composed and a very cool image though.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the color of the sky here. I think a less saturated sky would have brought out more of the water/rainbow. Perfectly composed and a very cool image though.', '2012-06-28 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803550, 1022247, 137320, '<td valign="top">Came back and bumped the score up to an 8. This image separates itself from the 7s with it''s clean lines, gorgeous use of shadows, and cool tones. (looks like a preset I made in SilverFX) Great decision keeping the sky dead black to accentuate the sharp lines. Well done.</td>', 'Came back and bumped the score up to an 8. This image separates itself from the 7s with it''s clean lines, gorgeous use of shadows, and cool tones. (looks like a preset I made in SilverFX) Great decision keeping the sky dead black to accentuate the sharp lines. Well done.', '2012-06-28 15:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803555, 1022681, 137320, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem like it''s going to score as well as I''d like, but it is one of my favorites. I could sit and name 100 reasons why I love it but I''ll stick with these: The varying color of the brick (looks like HDR) is not overdone, the greens taking over the picture on the left with the red brick being on the right really gives it a "Nature vs Man Made" feel, the vignetting has done it''s job very well and doesn''t "stand out", and the amount that the door is open is just perfect... if it''s open any more it creates an extra unflattering line.<br/>Overall my highest scored in this challenge. I REALLY hope it gets tt.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem like it''s going to score as well as I''d like, but it is one of my favorites. I could sit and name 100 reasons why I love it but I''ll stick with these: The varying color of the brick (looks like HDR) is not overdone, the greens taking over the picture on the left with the red brick being on the right really gives it a "Nature vs Man Made" feel, the vignetting has done it''s job very well and doesn''t "stand out", and the amount that the door is open is just perfect... if it''s open any more it creates an extra unflattering line.Overall my highest scored in this challenge. I REALLY hope it gets tt.', '2012-06-28 15:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803560, 1023010, 137320, '<td valign="top">The detail in the grass seems a bit lacking and the haloing on the left tower seems more prominent than the right one (maybe it''s just the darker clouds behind it). But the concept of this is just awesome! I still scored it a 7 and hope it does really well!</td>', 'The detail in the grass seems a bit lacking and the haloing on the left tower seems more prominent than the right one (maybe it''s just the darker clouds behind it). But the concept of this is just awesome! I still scored it a 7 and hope it does really well!', '2012-06-28 15:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803563, 1023050, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool capture. Although not technically great (contrast, focus, tones) an absolutely brilliant photograph. I gave this a 7 and think it was a breath of fresh air seeing some human emotion in the challenge!</td>', 'This is such a cool capture. Although not technically great (contrast, focus, tones) an absolutely brilliant photograph. I gave this a 7 and think it was a breath of fresh air seeing some human emotion in the challenge!', '2012-06-28 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803567, 1022929, 137320, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this one. I do think though, if you were to remove the puddles, then the eye can naturally follow the line all the way up to the beautiful structure. The way it is now, my eye starts at the bottom middle, then on the way up stops and looks at the puddles because it stands out so much. With that and a little less noise in the sky, I would have given it a 9, and picked it as my winner. Amazing photograph regardless, 7 from me.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this one. I do think though, if you were to remove the puddles, then the eye can naturally follow the line all the way up to the beautiful structure. The way it is now, my eye starts at the bottom middle, then on the way up stops and looks at the puddles because it stands out so much. With that and a little less noise in the sky, I would have given it a 9, and picked it as my winner. Amazing photograph regardless, 7 from me.', '2012-06-28 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6803568, 1022886, 66267, '<td valign="top">nice car shot, but i wouldnt reaaally consider it a structure. i think of a structure as something that''s static, immobile. even a structure that''s designed to move, like a windmill, essentially stays in the same place.</td>', 'nice car shot, but i wouldnt reaaally consider it a structure. i think of a structure as something that''s static, immobile. even a structure that''s designed to move, like a windmill, essentially stays in the same place.', '2012-06-28 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
