(6806924, 1022871, 38162, '<td valign="top">"pier shadows" - really, is it that hard to toss a title on it?  that crap aside, this is best yet.  10 (-1 for laziness) on title. 9.  gl.</td>', '"pier shadows" - really, is it that hard to toss a title on it?  that crap aside, this is best yet.  10 (-1 for laziness) on title. 9.  gl.', '2012-07-02 18:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
