(6808512, 1022928, 33736, '<td valign="top">Probably won''t score high because it''s not a structure, but a thing.  Having said that, though, it''s a pretty neat shot (minus the glaring circle in the right hand area.)  Hopefully, you''ll be able to use this idea for a future Challenge.</td>', 'Probably won''t score high because it''s not a structure, but a thing.  Having said that, though, it''s a pretty neat shot (minus the glaring circle in the right hand area.)  Hopefully, you''ll be able to use this idea for a future Challenge.', '2012-07-04 07:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
