(6808521, 1022871, 109387, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I read your words on the <i>new personal best</i> thread. Sometimes a few details make you lose some extra points: the horizon is not straight (in a landscape/architecture shot is one of the most important things), the lights flare are a little distracting and last but not least the title - I wouldn''t penalize you for forgetting it, but IMHO many people would.<br/> <br/>I hope this can be useful :)</td>', 'This is a nice image. I read your words on the new personal best thread. Sometimes a few details make you lose some extra points: the horizon is not straight (in a landscape/architecture shot is one of the most important things), the lights flare are a little distracting and last but not least the title - I wouldn''t penalize you for forgetting it, but IMHO many people would. I hope this can be useful :)', '2012-07-04 08:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
