(6808580, 1023043, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red. Beautiful shot, the colours are wonderful and the angle allows a lot to be included.</td>', 'Congratulations on the red. Beautiful shot, the colours are wonderful and the angle allows a lot to be included.', '2012-07-04 08:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6808589, 1022871, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, and congrats on the new PB! I agree with Alex. It might be worth considering next time you do a shot like this to throw the aperture down to about 18 or 20 or so. You''ll get a nice starburst effect on the lights, which I think can be effective. Then again it be more distracting, hard to say. <br/>Anyway. <br/>Congrats again! Very nicely balanced image.</td>', 'Very nice image, and congrats on the new PB! I agree with Alex. It might be worth considering next time you do a shot like this to throw the aperture down to about 18 or 20 or so. You''ll get a nice starburst effect on the lights, which I think can be effective. Then again it be more distracting, hard to say. Anyway. Congrats again! Very nicely balanced image.', '2012-07-04 09:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
