(6811093, 1022591, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you take this from across the river?  Love those reflections </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, Johanna.  Just from a slightly higher platform than the ground you see in the foreground.  It is in the main large square where Eiffel Tower is located.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-07-15 11:55:31.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Did you take this from across the river?  Love those reflections   No, Johanna.  Just from a slightly higher platform than the ground you see in the foreground.  It is in the main large square where Eiffel Tower is located.', '2012-07-06 18:59:27.000000', '2012-07-15 12:55:31.000000', 0),
