(6813080, 1022871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - love the light "trails" and especially love the curved shadow of the pier railing.  Do keep in mind that for some, titles are important, and the lack of one can cost you a point or two here and there.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Excellent capture - love the light "trails" and especially love the curved shadow of the pier railing.  Do keep in mind that for some, titles are important, and the lack of one can cost you a point or two here and there.  Keep up the good work!', '2012-07-08 22:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
